        "accession_number": "0001594805-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "Our business model has two revenue components: a recurring subscription component that we call subscription solutions and a merchant success-based component that we call merchant solutions.",
        "start_character": 3504,
        "end_character": 3693
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001594805-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001594805-26-000007-57f18fb1f3e3eda7",
        "accession_number": "0001594805-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We are currently subject to a variety of laws and regulations in Canada, the United States, the European Economic Area and elsewhere related to financial services.",
        "start_character": 17321,
        "end_character": 17484
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001594805-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001594805-26-000007-57f18fb1f3e3eda7",
        "accession_number": "0001594805-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We are subject to a number of foreign and domestic laws and regulations that may affect companies conducting business on the internet, many of which are still evolving and could be interpreted in ways that could adversely affect our business.",
        "start_character": 15976,
        "end_character": 16218
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001594805-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001594805-26-000007-57f18fb1f3e3eda7",
        "accession_number": "0001594805-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We intend to grow our base of merchants by both inspiring entrepreneurship through marketing programs and trial experiences and continuing to improve the ease with which merchants can get a new or existing business up and running with Shopify.",
        "start_character": 2708,
        "end_character": 2951
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001594805-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001594805-26-000007-57f18fb1f3e3eda7",
        "accession_number": "0001594805-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "Although, as a foreign private issuer, we are not required to do so, we have chosen to file annual reports on Form 10-K,",
